Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> statement_list
Rule 2     statement_list -> statement_list statement
Rule 3     statement_list -> statement
Rule 4     statement -> INT ID SEMICOLON
Rule 5     statement -> ID ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
Rule 6     expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 7     expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 8     expression -> expression MULT expression
Rule 9     expression -> expression DIV expression
Rule 10    expression -> LPAREN expression RPAREN
Rule 11    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 12    expression -> ID

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ASSIGN               : 5
DIV                  : 9
ID                   : 4 5 12
INT                  : 4
LPAREN               : 10
MINUS                : 7
MULT                 : 8
NUMBER               : 11
PLUS                 : 6
RPAREN               : 10
SEMICOLON            : 4 5
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

expression           : 5 6 6 7 7 8 8 9 9 10
program              : 0
statement            : 2 3
statement_list       : 1 2

Parsing method: LALR

